				Example(caption: "What a refusal looks like", captionPt: "Como uma recusa aparece", code: "$ hive check chats.hive\nchats.hive:14: in `everything`: this query reads `chats` without the filter law `ownChatsOnly` keeps on it\n    its WHERE has to carry `fk_contact_from_id = \{contact.id} OR fk_contact_to_id = \{contact.id}`", codePt: "$ hive check chats.hive\nchats.hive:14: in `everything`: this query reads `chats` without the filter law `ownChatsOnly` keeps on it\n    its WHERE has to carry `fk_contact_from_id = \{contact.id} OR fk_contact_to_id = \{contact.id}`"),
